"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwatkorn_me=self.webpackChunkwatkorn_me||[]).push([[91],{91:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"html":"<p>Capture The Flag (CTF) competitions are exciting challenges in cybersecurity.\\nProper preparation will help you improve your skills and enjoy the competition more.</p>\\n<p><img src=\\"/images/blogs/ctftime.png\\" alt=\\"CTF Preparation\\" loading=\\"lazy\\"></p>\\n<p>Before joining a CTF, make sure to strengthen your fundamentals in:</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Web security: SQL injection, XSS, CSRF</li>\\n<li>Cryptography: basic ciphers, hashing, encryption</li>\\n<li>Binary exploitation: buffer overflow, reverse engineering</li>\\n<li>Forensics: analyzing files, memory, network traffic</li>\\n<li>Networking: protocols, packet analysis, ports</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>Practice on platforms like Hack The Box, TryHackMe, and PicoCTF to gain hands-on experience\\nand learn new techniques.</p>\\n<p>Keep notes, create cheat sheets, and collaborate with teammates. This accelerates learning\\nand prepares you for real competitions.</p>\\n"}')}}]);